OL,3,ARussian bombing kills 18 people at
OL,4,AUkraine aid centre, Kyiv says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 18 people waiting to receive
OL,7,Fhumanitarian aid in a Ukrainian village
OL,8,Fhave been killed in a Russian attack
OL,9,Fthat Ukraine's leader has called
OL,10,F"utterly horrific".
OL,12,FFive people were injured and another 27
OL,13,Fare still missing after at least nine
OL,14,F3,000kg aerial bombs hit the village of
OL,15,FKomyshuvakha in the southern
OL,16,FZaporizhzhia region, regional head
OL,17,FMykhailo Semikin said.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
