OL,3,ARussian bombing kills 18 people at
OL,4,AUkraine aid centre, Kyiv says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said that
OL,7,Fafter the first strike on the local
OL,8,Fschool "used for humanitarian needs",
OL,9,Fthere was a second attack on the place
OL,10,Fwhere people were sheltering.
OL,12,FHe posted a video showing a huge crater
OL,13,Fleft after Monday's attack, and rescue
OL,14,Fteams searching through the rubble.
